{"submitted_utc": "20261031T000632213Z", "team_member": "seongeun", "experiment": "e2000fs_calib2_detroute", "description": "Dedicated exceedance classifier with causal routing between two archived arms: a binary:logistic detector (three per-24h-band models per stage, horizon index as a feature, origin+144h<=cutoff mask) routes each (origin,horizon) pair to the mixture2comp tail arm when p>=0.234 or to the tweedie15 body arm otherwise. tau=0.234 was fixed a priori from the cost ratio C_fp/(C_fp+C_fn)=1233/(1233+4045) and never tuned on F1/F2. Official F1+F2: total MSE 3213.2 (tweedie15 3227.6, mixture 3746.0), >=550 7343.4, F1>=550 6566.4, F2>=550 8136.8 - a strict Pareto improvement over tweedie15 on both metrics, but the three-condition rule and the stated target (total<3200, all >=550<6000) are not met. Detector at tau: POD 0.699, FAR 0.393, precision 0.607; detection is weakest in F2 at h25-48 (POD 0.48) and h49-72 (POD 0.56). Archived replay replays the routed forecast from the two archived arm forecasts and the archived exceedance probabilities.", "f1_training_data_end_utc": "2026-02-26T00:00:00Z", "config": {"data": {"asset": {"filename": "forecast.npz", "sha256": "e7bbdbdf7cd211b95a87186b0d2f79e0ca17c2c132dd8da8ebb4964655438985"}, "inputs_sha256": {}, "origins": 4970, "rows": 357840, "source": "forecast.npz"}, "hyperparameters": {"base_scores_archived": null, "candidate_scores_archived": null, "discipline": "", "lane": "detector", "selection": {}}}, "config_sha256": "e2457303ad54fe568c2b239ebf6b4f9b53657e60473284c276097f14f34a2acb", "inference_seconds_per_fold": 3e-05, "code_url": "https://github.com/TLAB-HGU/sunrun-leaderboard/blob/main/scripts/seongeun/e2000fs_calib2_detroute/e2457303ad54fe568c2b239ebf6b4f9b53657e60473284c276097f14f34a2acb.py", "mse": 3213.1918684481543, "mse_ge550": 7343.427492730721, "mse_f1": 3551.7401177440747, "mse_f1_ge550": 6566.353652607389, "mse_f2": 2957.816785940078, "mse_f2_ge550": 8136.83621838217, "n_pairs_ge550": 48456, "n_p